{
  "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
  "sourceName": "Saheeh International",
  "language": "en",
  "direction": "ltr",
  "surahNumber": 37,
  "entries": [
    {
      "verseKey": "37:1",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 1,
      "text": "By those [angels] lined up in rows",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:2",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 2,
      "text": "And those who drive [the clouds]",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:3",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 3,
      "text": "And those who recite the message,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:4",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 4,
      "text": "Indeed, your God is One,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:5",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 5,
      "text": "Lord of the heavens and the earth and that between them and Lord of the sunrises.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:6",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 6,
      "text": "Indeed, We have adorned the nearest heaven with an adornment of stars",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:7",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 7,
      "text": "And as protection against every rebellious devil",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:8",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 8,
      "text": "[So] they may not listen to the exalted assembly [of angels] and are pelted from every side,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:9",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 9,
      "text": "Repelled; and for them is a constant punishment,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:10",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 10,
      "text": "Except one who snatches [some words] by theft, but they are pursued by a burning flame, piercing [in brightness].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:11",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 11,
      "text": "Then inquire of them, [O Muḥammad], \"Are they a stronger [or more difficult] creation or those [others] We have created?\" Indeed, We created them [i.e., men] from sticky clay.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:12",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 12,
      "text": "But you wonder, while they mock,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:13",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 13,
      "text": "And when they are reminded, they remember not.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:14",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 14,
      "text": "And when they see a sign, they ridicule.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:15",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 15,
      "text": "And say, \"This is not but obvious magic.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:16",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 16,
      "text": "When we have died and become dust and bones, are we indeed to be resurrected?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:17",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 17,
      "text": "And our forefathers [as well]?\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:18",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 18,
      "text": "Say, \"Yes, and you will be [rendered] contemptible.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:19",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 19,
      "text": "It will be only one shout, and at once they will be observing.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:20",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 20,
      "text": "They will say, \"O woe to us! This is the Day of Recompense.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:21",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 21,
      "text": "[They will be told], \"This is the Day of Judgement which you used to deny.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:22",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 22,
      "text": "[The angels will be ordered], \"Gather those who committed wrong, their kinds, and what they used to worship",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:23",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 23,
      "text": "Other than Allāh, and guide them to the path of Hellfire",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:24",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 24,
      "text": "And stop them; indeed, they are to be questioned.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:25",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 25,
      "text": "[They will be asked], \"What is [wrong] with you? Why do you not help each other?\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:26",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 26,
      "text": "But they, that Day, are in surrender.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:27",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 27,
      "text": "And they will approach one another asking [i.e., blaming] each other.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:28",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 28,
      "text": "They will say, \"Indeed, you used to come at us from the right.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:29",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 29,
      "text": "They [i.e., the oppressors] will say, \"Rather, you [yourselves] were not believers,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:30",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 30,
      "text": "And we had over you no authority, but you were a transgressing people.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:31",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 31,
      "text": "So the word [i.e., decree] of our Lord has come into effect upon us; indeed, we will taste [punishment].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:32",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 32,
      "text": "And we led you to deviation; indeed, we were deviators.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:33",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 33,
      "text": "So indeed they, that Day, will be sharing in the punishment.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:34",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 34,
      "text": "Indeed, that is how We deal with the criminals.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:35",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 35,
      "text": "Indeed they, when it was said to them, \"There is no deity but Allāh,\" were arrogant",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:36",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 36,
      "text": "And were saying, \"Are we to leave our gods for a mad poet?\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:37",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 37,
      "text": "Rather, he [i.e., the Prophet (ﷺ)] has come with the truth and confirmed the [previous] messengers.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:38",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 38,
      "text": "Indeed, you [disbelievers] will be tasters of the painful punishment,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:39",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 39,
      "text": "And you will not be recompensed except for what you used to do -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:40",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 40,
      "text": "But not the chosen servants of Allāh.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:41",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 41,
      "text": "Those will have a provision determined -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:42",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 42,
      "text": "Fruits; and they will be honored",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:43",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 43,
      "text": "In gardens of pleasure",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:44",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 44,
      "text": "On thrones facing one another.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:45",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 45,
      "text": "There will be circulated among them a cup [of wine] from a flowing spring,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:46",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 46,
      "text": "White and delicious to the drinkers;",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:47",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 47,
      "text": "No bad effect is there in it, nor from it will they be intoxicated.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:48",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 48,
      "text": "And with them will be women limiting [their] glances, with large, [beautiful] eyes,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:49",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 49,
      "text": "As if they were [delicate] eggs, well-protected.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:50",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 50,
      "text": "And they will approach one another, inquiring of each other.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:51",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 51,
      "text": "A speaker among them will say, \"Indeed, I had a companion [on earth].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:52",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 52,
      "text": "Who would say, 'Are you indeed of those who believe",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:53",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 53,
      "text": "That when we have died and become dust and bones, we will indeed be recompensed?'\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:54",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 54,
      "text": "He will say, \"Would you [care to] look?\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:55",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 55,
      "text": "And he will look and see him in the midst of the Hellfire.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:56",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 56,
      "text": "He will say, \"By Allāh, you almost ruined me.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:57",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 57,
      "text": "If not for the favor of my Lord, I would have been of those brought in [to Hell].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:58",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 58,
      "text": "Then, are we not to die",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:59",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 59,
      "text": "Except for our first death, and we will not be punished?\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:60",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 60,
      "text": "Indeed, this is the great attainment.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:61",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 61,
      "text": "For the like of this let the workers [on earth] work.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:62",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 62,
      "text": "Is that [i.e., Paradise] a better accommodation or the tree of zaqqūm?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:63",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 63,
      "text": "Indeed, We have made it a torment for the wrongdoers.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:64",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 64,
      "text": "Indeed, it is a tree issuing from the bottom of the Hellfire,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:65",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 65,
      "text": "Its emerging fruit as if it was heads of the devils.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:66",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 66,
      "text": "And indeed, they will eat from it and fill with it their bellies.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:67",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 67,
      "text": "Then indeed, they will have after it a mixture of scalding water.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:68",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 68,
      "text": "Then indeed, their return will be to the Hellfire.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:69",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 69,
      "text": "Indeed they found their fathers astray.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:70",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 70,
      "text": "So they hastened [to follow] in their footsteps.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:71",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 71,
      "text": "And there had already strayed before them most of the former peoples,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:72",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 72,
      "text": "And We had already sent among them warners.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:73",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 73,
      "text": "Then look how was the end of those who were warned -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:74",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 74,
      "text": "But not the chosen servants of Allāh.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:75",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 75,
      "text": "And Noah had certainly called Us, and [We are] the best of responders.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:76",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 76,
      "text": "And We saved him and his family from the great affliction.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:77",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 77,
      "text": "And We made his descendants those remaining [on the earth]",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:78",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 78,
      "text": "And left for him [favorable mention] among later generations:",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:79",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 79,
      "text": "\"Peace upon Noah among the worlds.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:80",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 80,
      "text": "Indeed, We thus reward the doers of good.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:81",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 81,
      "text": "Indeed, he was of Our believing servants.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:82",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 82,
      "text": "Then We drowned the others [i.e., disbelievers].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:83",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 83,
      "text": "And indeed, among his kind was Abraham,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:84",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 84,
      "text": "When he came to his Lord with a sound heart",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:85",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 85,
      "text": "[And] when he said to his father and his people, \"What do you worship?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:86",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 86,
      "text": "Is it falsehood [as] gods other than Allāh you desire?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:87",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 87,
      "text": "Then what is your thought about the Lord of the worlds?\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:88",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 88,
      "text": "And he cast a look at the stars",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:89",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 89,
      "text": "And said, \"Indeed, I am [about to be] ill.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:90",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 90,
      "text": "So they turned away from him, departing.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:91",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 91,
      "text": "Then he turned to their gods and said, \"Do you not eat?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:92",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 92,
      "text": "What is [wrong] with you that you do not speak?\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:93",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 93,
      "text": "And he turned upon them a blow with [his] right hand.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:94",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 94,
      "text": "Then they [i.e., the people] came toward him, hastening.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:95",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 95,
      "text": "He said, \"Do you worship that which you [yourselves] carve,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:96",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 96,
      "text": "While Allāh created you and that which you do?\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:97",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 97,
      "text": "They said, \"Construct for him a structure [i.e., furnace] and throw him into the burning fire.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:98",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 98,
      "text": "And they intended for him a plan [i.e., harm], but We made them the most debased.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:99",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 99,
      "text": "And [then] he said, \"Indeed, I will go to [where I am ordered by] my Lord; He will guide me.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:100",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 100,
      "text": "My Lord, grant me [a child] from among the righteous.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:101",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 101,
      "text": "So We gave him good tidings of a forbearing boy.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:102",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 102,
      "text": "And when he reached with him [the age of] exertion, he said, \"O my son, indeed I have seen in a dream that I [must] sacrifice you, so see what you think.\" He said, \"O my father, do as you are commanded. You will find me, if Allāh wills, of the steadfast.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:103",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 103,
      "text": "And when they had both submitted and he put him down upon his forehead,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:104",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 104,
      "text": "We called to him, \"O Abraham,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:105",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 105,
      "text": "You have fulfilled the vision.\" Indeed, We thus reward the doers of good.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:106",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 106,
      "text": "Indeed, this was the clear trial.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:107",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 107,
      "text": "And We ransomed him with a great sacrifice,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:108",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 108,
      "text": "And We left for him [favorable mention] among later generations:",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:109",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 109,
      "text": "\"Peace upon Abraham.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:110",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 110,
      "text": "Indeed, We thus reward the doers of good.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:111",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 111,
      "text": "Indeed, he was of Our believing servants.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:112",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 112,
      "text": "And We gave him good tidings of Isaac, a prophet from among the righteous.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:113",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 113,
      "text": "And We blessed him and Isaac. But among their descendants is the doer of good and the clearly unjust to himself [i.e., sinner].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:114",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 114,
      "text": "And We did certainly confer favor upon Moses and Aaron.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:115",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 115,
      "text": "And We saved them and their people from the great affliction,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:116",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 116,
      "text": "And We supported them so it was they who overcame.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:117",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 117,
      "text": "And We gave them the explicit Scripture [i.e., the Torah],",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:118",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 118,
      "text": "And We guided them on the straight path.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:119",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 119,
      "text": "And We left for them [favorable mention] among later generations:",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:120",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 120,
      "text": "\"Peace upon Moses and Aaron.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:121",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 121,
      "text": "Indeed, We thus reward the doers of good.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:122",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 122,
      "text": "Indeed, they were of Our believing servants.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:123",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 123,
      "text": "And indeed, Elias was from among the messengers,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:124",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 124,
      "text": "When he said to his people, \"Will you not fear Allāh?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:125",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 125,
      "text": "Do you call upon Baʿl and leave the best of creators -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:126",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 126,
      "text": "Allāh, your Lord and the Lord of your first forefathers?\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:127",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 127,
      "text": "And they denied him, so indeed, they will be brought [for punishment],",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:128",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 128,
      "text": "Except the chosen servants of Allāh.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:129",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 129,
      "text": "And We left for him [favorable mention] among later generations:",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:130",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 130,
      "text": "\"Peace upon Elias.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:131",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 131,
      "text": "Indeed, We thus reward the doers of good.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:132",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 132,
      "text": "Indeed, he was of Our believing servants.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:133",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 133,
      "text": "And indeed, Lot was among the messengers.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:134",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 134,
      "text": "[So mention] when We saved him and his family, all,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:135",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 135,
      "text": "Except an old woman [i.e., his wife] among those who remained [with the evildoers].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:136",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 136,
      "text": "Then We destroyed the others.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:137",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 137,
      "text": "And indeed, you pass by them in the morning",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:138",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 138,
      "text": "And at night. Then will you not use reason?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:139",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 139,
      "text": "And indeed, Jonah was among the messengers.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:140",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 140,
      "text": "[Mention] when he ran away to the laden ship.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:141",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 141,
      "text": "And he drew lots and was among the losers.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:142",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 142,
      "text": "Then the fish swallowed him, while he was blameworthy.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:143",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 143,
      "text": "And had he not been of those who exalt Allāh,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:144",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 144,
      "text": "He would have remained inside its belly until the Day they are resurrected.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:145",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 145,
      "text": "But We threw him onto the open shore while he was ill.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:146",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 146,
      "text": "And We caused to grow over him a gourd vine.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:147",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 147,
      "text": "And We sent him to [his people of] a hundred thousand or more.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:148",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 148,
      "text": "And they believed, so We gave them enjoyment [of life] for a time.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:149",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 149,
      "text": "So inquire of them, [O Muḥammad], \"Does your Lord have daughters while they have sons?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:150",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 150,
      "text": "Or did We create the angels as females while they were witnesses?\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:151",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 151,
      "text": "Unquestionably, it is out of their [invented] falsehood that they say,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:152",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 152,
      "text": "\"Allāh has begotten,\" and indeed, they are liars.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:153",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 153,
      "text": "Has He chosen daughters over sons?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:154",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 154,
      "text": "What is [wrong] with you? How do you make judgement?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:155",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 155,
      "text": "Then will you not be reminded?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:156",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 156,
      "text": "Or do you have a clear authority?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:157",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 157,
      "text": "Then produce your scripture, if you should be truthful.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:158",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 158,
      "text": "And they have made [i.e., claimed] between Him and the jinn a lineage, but the jinn have already known that they [who made such claims] will be brought [to punishment].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:159",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 159,
      "text": "Exalted is Allāh above what they describe,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:160",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 160,
      "text": "Except the chosen servants of Allāh [who do not share in that sin].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:161",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 161,
      "text": "So indeed, you [disbelievers] and whatever you worship,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:162",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 162,
      "text": "You cannot tempt [anyone] away from Him",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:163",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 163,
      "text": "Except he who is to [enter and] burn in the Hellfire.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:164",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 164,
      "text": "[The angels say], \"There is not among us any except that he has a known position.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:165",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 165,
      "text": "And indeed, we are those who line up [for prayer].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:166",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 166,
      "text": "And indeed, we are those who exalt Allāh.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:167",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 167,
      "text": "And indeed, they [i.e., the disbelievers] used to say,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:168",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 168,
      "text": "\"If we had a message from [those of] the former peoples,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:169",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 169,
      "text": "We would have been the chosen servants of Allāh.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:170",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 170,
      "text": "But they disbelieved in it, so they are going to know.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:171",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 171,
      "text": "And Our word [i.e., decree] has already preceded for Our servants, the messengers,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:172",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 172,
      "text": "[That] indeed, they would be those given victory",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:173",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 173,
      "text": "And [that] indeed, Our soldiers [i.e., the believers] will be those who overcome.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:174",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 174,
      "text": "So, [O Muḥammad], leave them for a time.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:175",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 175,
      "text": "And see [what will befall] them, for they are going to see.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:176",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 176,
      "text": "Then for Our punishment are they impatient?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:177",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 177,
      "text": "But when it descends in their territory, then evil is the morning of those who were warned.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:178",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 178,
      "text": "And leave them for a time.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:179",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 179,
      "text": "And see, for they are going to see.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:180",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 180,
      "text": "Exalted is your Lord, the Lord of might, above what they describe.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:181",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 181,
      "text": "And peace upon the messengers.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "37:182",
      "surahNumber": 37,
      "ayahNumber": 182,
      "text": "And praise to Allāh, Lord of the worlds.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    }
  ]
